msgstr ""
"Cut slabs from a bulk structure over ranges of Miller indices, layer counts, "
"and vacuum thicknesses, covering multiple surface orientations and "
"geometries."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:11
