msgid "卡片对 Miller 指数、层数和真空厚度做笛卡尔积扫描："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:15
