#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:20
#: ea81ab4685a84105bf0cf1acfef9fcbd
msgid ""
"对每个组合调用周期表面构造，把 $(hkl)$ 平面作为表面法向，沿法向堆叠 $L$ 层； "
"$v>0$ 时在法向加入对应 Å 数的真空，$v=0$ 时不额外加真空。输出数的理论上限是各"
"扫描 点数的乘积减去 $(0,0,0)$ 组合。失败的不可构造晶面会记录并跳过，因此实际"
"输出可能更少。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:24
#: 6bd7fd1870bf4765b25ebc545c552bf0
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:26
#: 3e9893ffac7d40fcbd114653f7596baa
msgid "场景：模型在表面吸附能上系统性偏离 DFT"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: model adsorption energies are systematically biased relative to DFT"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:28
#: 14454119040043d4b9a1f85c62c41432
msgid ""
"你在体相 Pt 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相弹性和声子都很好。然后跑 Pt(111) 表面"
"上的 CO 吸附能——模型预测的吸附能比 DFT 弱 0.5 eV，误差远超可接受范围。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model on bulk Pt and obtained good elastic and phonon "
"properties. For CO adsorption on Pt(111), however, the predicted adsorption "
"is 0.5 eV weaker than DFT, well outside the acceptable error."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:30
#: 2a1138d6106f4b528973a0d4ed577a99
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集里全是体相 Pt 结构，模型从来没见过表面的低配位原子。"
"Pt(111) 表面的台阶位、平台位的局域环境与体相完全不同——配位数从 12 降到 9 甚至"
"更低。模型需要见过多种表面取向和厚度的 slab 才能泛化到表面化学。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The training set contains only bulk Pt, so the model has "
"never seen undercoordinated surface atoms. Terrace and step environments on "
"Pt(111) differ strongly from bulk coordination, dropping from 12 neighbors "
"to 9 or fewer. Include slabs with multiple orientations and thicknesses "
"before expecting transfer to surface chemistry."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:32
#: 03dfe7fd14f142aca7085957d6eb04d6
msgid "**输入：** 一个体相 fcc Pt 单胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A bulk fcc Pt unit cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:34
#: 2937a9a7de734ad48038d5a41005d52e
msgid "**目标：** 切出 (111) 面，3~6 层厚，10 Å 真空，覆盖多种 Miller 指数组合"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate slabs spanning several Miller-index combinations, with 3–"
"6 layers and 10 Å of vacuum, including the (111) surface."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:36
#: 555d59b597e34a82a5ad17e5b0514a9c
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:37
#: 512ee5bdfa8b4f23b00bc769f2f4df5c
msgid ""
"`Miller 指数 h 范围`（`h_range`） = `[0, 1, 1]`，`Miller 指数 k 范围`"
"（`k_range`） = `[0, 1, 1]`，`Miller 指数 l 范围`（`l_range`） = `[1, 3, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:38
#: b8fc2940a15f4876a967cb93628f0f36
msgid "`Layer Range` = `[3, 6, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:39
#: 519f5be470864566881cd185b70efd40
msgid "`真空层范围`（`vacuum_range`） = `[10, 10, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:41
#: 8e103bcb34314cd9844e2350710054b6
msgid ""
"**输出：** 多个 slab 结构，覆盖不同 hkl 组合、3~6 层厚度、10 Å 真空，带 "
"`Slab(hkl=...,L=...,vac=...)` 标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Slab structures over the selected *hkl* combinations and 3–6 "
"layer thicknesses with 10 Å vacuum, labeled `Slab(hkl=...,L=...,vac=...)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:43
#: 8b63b0fd97794f09a5b10a6972bb17d4
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:44
#: fbc53cb452134d65ba0790bd9ca76eee
msgid "重训后计算 Pt(111) 上的 CO 吸附能，应该接近 DFT 参考"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, recalculate CO adsorption on Pt(111) and "
"compare it with the DFT reference."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:45
#: 95f43e4ac7064d2997ae4f9f6004c6c0
msgid "检查 slab 上下表面没有重叠，真空层足够隔离周期镜像"
msgstr ""
"Check that the two slab surfaces do not overlap and that the vacuum "
"separates periodic images adequately."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:46
#: eba2d5dc58db4e9680f0cec66308c8d7
msgid ""
"如果表面能预测仍不准，扩大 `Miller 指数 l 范围`（`l_range`）到 `[1, 5, 1]` 覆"
"盖更多高指数面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:47
#: f052314feb544cec965b9fc7240bc335
msgid "如果 slab 太薄表面效应过强，增大 `层数范围`（`layer_range`）的下限"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:49
#: 28aa559f50fc46f6ae7a34b4a3f5b232
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:51
#: 7329fa39e99745fcb435fa9a49ee8b51
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:52
#: af01f3dd1bf14cf997a938bcd5a9d419
msgid "模型在表面相关任务（吸附、表面能、表面反应）上预测差"
msgstr ""
"The model is inaccurate for adsorption, surface energies, or surface "
"reactions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:53
#: f05b0e03843f4fe9b81f7f1c55b1d4d7
msgid "需要覆盖多种表面取向和厚度"
msgstr "You need to cover several surface orientations and thicknesses."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:54
#: a0d9e4b7aaa94d679a8a73c80441fa6d
msgid "作为后续吸附/缺陷卡片的母结构"
msgstr "You need parent slabs for downstream adsorption or defect cards."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:56
#: 946529cde7994374a72133f1e85f045b
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:57
#: db558f3697314d88b90949e0d9430778
msgid "只做体相性质训练，不需要表面结构"
msgstr ""
"The model targets bulk properties only and does not need surface structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:58
#: ca9fc57993f04a38a0673df24e98af13
msgid "已经手动切好了 slab，只需要做表面修饰"
msgstr ""
"The required slabs have already been prepared and only surface modification "
"is needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:60
#: e7bc15b518b04488bbaf489760353bf9
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:62
#: 1b8d7ffade684ce8be4bd9bc9934101c
msgid "Miller 指数 h 范围（h_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:64
#: 58a818ace7324872ac8145cafbc3b71a
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 (0, 1, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，整数，定义切片的 "
"Miller h 指数搜索空间。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(0, 1, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for the Miller *h* index."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:66
#: 2e7a92c6512f4d989ee4bd58b02c9e50
msgid ""
"hkl 为 (0,0,0) 的组合自动跳过。填参数之前先心算一下：输出总数 = (h 点数) x "
"(k 点数) x (l 点数) x (层数) x (真空数)——别让五重循环悄悄把输出量炸了。"
msgstr ""
"The `(0, 0, 0)` combination is skipped. Before running, estimate the output "
"count as `Nh × Nk × Nl × Nlayers × Nvacuum`; the five nested ranges can grow "
"quickly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:68
#: 3c34e982c1814b7f8755dafa57a6ab99
msgid "Miller 指数 k 范围（k_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:70
#: 7703d488c0f34f848c129bbe5ae04129
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 (0, 1, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，和上面 h 一样用"
"法。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(0, 1, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for the Miller *k* index."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:72
#: a9584add0af54a1bb6edff216d98d84a
msgid ""
"h/k 设 [0,1,1] 只出低指数面，[0,2,1] 覆盖中等取向，[0,3,1] 进入探索区——组合数"
"增长很快，注意控制范围。"
msgstr ""
"Using `[0,1,1]` for *h* and *k* limits the scan to low-index values; "
"`[0,2,1]` broadens it, while `[0,3,1]` is exploratory. Control both ranges "
"because their combinations multiply."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:74
#: d7932ea5a0614729860c3d5fc3cfef16
msgid "Miller 指数 l 范围（l_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:76
#: ad90259b708f4b808fe6f66a21d58b46
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 (1, 3, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`。注意 l 的默认起点"
"不是 0，因为 (0,0,0) 没意义会直接跳过。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(1, 3, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for the Miller *l* index. Its default starts at 1 because `(0, 0, 0)` "
"is undefined and would be skipped."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:78
#: 0f398b6012f6423ea0a9c597329f5e1f
msgid ""
"保守用 [1,1,1] 只切一个面；平衡用 [1,3,1] 覆盖 3 个不同 l 的面；探索用 "
"[1,5,1] 但要准备好让输出数被五重循环放大。"
msgstr ""
"Use `[1,1,1]` for a single *l* value, `[1,3,1]` for routine coverage, and "
"`[1,5,1]` for exploration, accounting for multiplication by all other ranges."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:80
#: ebb0934abed3416d83e176437cc2696a
msgid "层数范围（layer_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:82
#: 2ae6344dd1064b468a073edd5c441b8c
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 (3, 6, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，整数，控制每个 "
"slab 的厚度（层数）。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(3, 6, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for slab thickness in atomic layers."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:84
#: 88bca5f347fa4bb6acfb58c714f69825
msgid ""
"3~6 层是标准 slab 厚度——上下表面的原子环境已经近似体相了，表面能收敛不会因为"
"厚度不够而飘。1~2 层的超薄 slab 量子尺寸效应明显，除非你有明确的物理原因，否"
"则谨慎使用。8 层以上的厚 slab 对 DFT 预算不友好。"
msgstr ""
"Three to six layers is a practical starting range, but convergence must be "
"checked for the material and property of interest. One- or two-layer slabs "
"can show strong finite-size effects; slabs above eight layers increase DFT "
"cost substantially."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:86
#: cb6c1062ac664552ae37bc5ea400aab6
msgid "真空层范围（vacuum_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:88
#: 102559c83fdb47618c82f5b014e2d4ce
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (10, 10, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(10, 10, 1)`. Vacuum-thickness range in Å, "
"expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:90
#: b3eddf1f0ed647bd876b4f3ff7334252
msgid ""
"10 Å 对大多数场景是可靠的下限，足够隔断周期镜像之间的相互作用。如果你后续要在"
"表面放吸附分子，拉高到 15-20 Å 确保吸附物不碰到镜像 slab。低于 5 Å 不建议用——"
"镜像 slab 的电子密度会穿透真空层。"
msgstr ""
"Ten Å is a common starting point, but vacuum convergence remains system "
"dependent. For adsorbates, 15–20 Å may be needed to avoid contact with the "
"periodic image. Vacuum below 5 Å is generally unsafe for isolated-slab "
"calculations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:92
#: 79e299bc07ae4905b2b4f1dbdeb29c76
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:94
#: f03e029b20f243bc9f491c069e2eea79
msgid "低指数面（111，3~6 层，10 Å，少量输出）"
msgstr "Low-index surfaces ((111), 3–6 layers, 10 Å vacuum, few outputs)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:95
#: 463daa579d544eb0b4752a5f7aea700b
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"h_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"k_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"l_range\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"layer_range\": [3, 6, 1],\n"
"  \"vacuum_range\": [10, 10, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:107
#: 13bafad1b94a42adb56c725499440fd5
msgid "多取向覆盖（h/k 0-1, l 1-3，3~6 层，10-15 Å）"
msgstr ""
"Multiple orientations (*h/k*: 0–1, *l*: 1–3; 3–6 layers; 10–15 Å vacuum)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:108
#: 229421cd333949a497b8d1d55c840dd7
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"h_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"k_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"l_range\": [1, 3, 1],\n"
"  \"layer_range\": [3, 6, 1],\n"
"  \"vacuum_range\": [10, 15, 5]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:120
#: 73ecfdb8d93047dfa8f89b9346b410fe
msgid "全取向探索（h/k 0-2, l 1-5，3~9 层，10-20 Å）"
msgstr ""
"Broad orientation exploration (*h/k*: 0–2, *l*: 1–5; 3–9 layers; 10–20 Å "
"vacuum)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:121
#: 6576651aba864f92ab65ec5029330752
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"h_range\": [0, 2, 1],\n"
"  \"k_range\": [0, 2, 1],\n"
