"`Super Cell` → `Random Slab`: enlarge the in-plane dimensions before cutting "
"slabs."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:139
#: 9f1b46652c59411895176155b8627087
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:141
#: aa73c99f627b44b497d15378968f771d
msgid ""
"**输出为空。** 通常因为 (0,0,0) 被跳过后没有有效 hkl 组合，或者体相的 Miller "
"指数组合和晶格不兼容。"
msgstr ""
"**No structures are produced.** After `(0, 0, 0)` is removed, the selected "
"ranges may contain no valid Miller combination, or the bulk lattice may be "
"incompatible with the requested cut."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:143
#: 5ed5bf836f144c3784fb720ec9487f42
msgid ""
"**输出数量爆炸。** h_range、k_range、l_range、layer_range、vacuum_range 五重"
"循环。先估算：Nh x Nk x Nl x Nlayer x Nvacuum。如果数字太大，先收窄 l_range "
"和 layer_range。"
msgstr ""
"**The output count is unexpectedly large.** The five ranges form a Cartesian "
"product. Estimate `Nh × Nk × Nl × Nlayer × Nvacuum`; if it is too large, "
"narrow `l_range` and `layer_range` first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:145
#: 2dd66930066a41188532682af7836b02
msgid ""
"**Slab 上下表面重叠。** layer_range 下限太小时，slab 厚度可能小于 2 层原子间"
"距。增大下限。"
msgstr ""
"**The upper and lower slab surfaces overlap or interact too strongly.** The "
"lower bound of `layer_range` is too small. Increase it and recheck thickness "
"convergence."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:147
